  "Inflict 1 foe with [Queen's Gaze]. Decrease DEF by <color=#FFFC40>$1</color>, also decrease DEF by $3 for every $2 ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color> ATK) and increase DMG Taken by $6 for every every $5 ATK (up to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> ATK). This effect is permanent. Only 1 [Queen's Gaze] can be active. When selecting a new target, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the new target. When the target with [Queen's Gaze] is defeated, pass [Queen's Gaze] to the highest HP foe. When passing [Queen's Gaze], pass all debuffs inflicted by Mitsuru. Mitsuru can use other skills, this doesn't count as a Persona skill.": "",
