  "E<color=#000000>n</color>ergy Mark": "",
  "r:\"^Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\.\\nInflict (\\d+) Frostbound stacks on the target, and for every (\\d+) of Mitsuru's Attack, decrease the target's Defense by ([\\d\\.]+)% times the amount of Frostbound stacks for (\\d+) turns \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> of Attack\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>Envelop the enemy in sharp petals of frost, dealing Ice damage to a single target\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Inflict Imperious Queen on 1 foe\\.\\nDecrease target's Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>, and decrease Defense by ([\\d\\.]+)% more for every (\\d+) of Mitsuru's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> of Attack\\)\\. Also, increase damage taken by ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) of Mitsuru's Attack \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> of Attack\\)\\. These effects are permanent\\.\\nImperious Queen can only be active on 1 target at a time and will automatically transfer to the new target whenever this skill is used\\. When a target with Imperious Queen is KO'd, it will transfer to the foe with the highest HP, and all debuffs inflicted by Mitsuru will also transfer\\.\\nAfter using this skill, Mitsuru can use another skill in the same turn \\(this skill does not count as a normal skill\\)\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>A storm of unfathomable cold surrounds an enemy, reducing its Defense\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's stats by ([\\d\\.]+)% of Elucidator's stats for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nDeal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack\\. For every Frostbound stack, increase skill damage by ([\\d\\.]+)%\\. Additionally, when the target has (\\d+) or more Frostbound stacks, increase this skill's damage by ([\\d\\.]+)% and increase critical rate of this skill by ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#C0C0C0>With slashes of ice that steal away the enemy's freedom and elegant swordplay that never misses an opening, inflict Ice damage on 1 target\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Penthesilea：Can be activated when Theurgy gauge is at (\\d+)\\. Deal Ice damage to 1 foe equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Attack, and for (\\d+) turns, evolve Frostbound stacks on the target to <link\\=\"s\\|264\"><u>Snowbound</u></link> and increase damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\.\\nWhen an ally uses a skill to attack a foe inflicted with Snowbound, activate <link\\=\"s\\|266\"><u>Iceblade</u></link> 1 time, dealing damage equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of that ally's Attack for every Frostbound stack on the target\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Ice damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nAssist：Inflict Charged Mark on 1 foe for (\\d+) turns\\.\\nThe first time that each ally attacks a foe inflicted with Charged Mark, increase the Theurgy gauge by (\\d+) if that ally has a Theurgy, or increase the Highlight gauge by (\\d+)% if that ally has a Highlight\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Decrease any Elucidator's first cooldown time by <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> actions\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^If Mitsuru is on the field, when Assassin and Sweeper allies attack foes inflicted with Frostbound, increase damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> times the number of Frostbound stacks\\.$\"": "",
  "When Mitsuru deals skill or Theurgy damage, inflict 1 Frostbound stack on the target. When using the same skill as the previous skill, inflict 3 more Frostbound stacks after the attack. Lasts for 2 turns. Stacks up to 5 times.\\nWhen Mitsuru attacks a foe inflicted with Frostbound, increase Attack by 7% for every Frostbound stack on the target.\\nWhen an ally uses a skill to attack a foe inflicted with <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>Snowbound</u></link>, activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>Iceblade</u></link>.": "",
  "At the start of battle, inflict all foes with 2 stacks of <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>Snowbound</u></link> (this stack can exceed max limit, stacks up to 2 times). This effect is permanent. Increase critical taken rate for foes inflicted with Snowbound by 10%.": "",
  "Increase critical damage taken for foes in the Imperious Queen state by 50%. When transferring Imperious Queen, transfer all debuffs to target.": "",
  "Increase skill levels of Frozen Tempest and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "Increase Theurgy damage by 20%, and increase the target's damage taken by 25% more for 2 turns.": "",
  "Increase skill levels of Flower of Ice and Snowpierced Waltz by 3.": "",
  "Increase the maximum number of Frostbound stacks to 6.\\nDouble the rate at which Mitsuru's Theurgy gauge is filled. When using a Theurgy, evolve <link\\=\"s|264\"><u>Snowbound</u></link> to <link\\=\"s|265\"><u>Glacierbound</u></link> on the target for 2 turns.\\nWhen allies use skills to attack foes inflicted with Glacierbound, also activate <link\\=\"s|266\"><u>Iceblade</u></link> 1 more time at 200% of its original damage.\\nWhen Mitsuru attacks foes inflicted with Glacierbound, increase <link\\=\"s|236\"><u>final damage amplification</u></link> by 15%.": "",
  "r:\"^Ice dmg to 1 foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\.\\\\nInflict (\\d+) Frostbound on target\\. Decrease target's Def by ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) of Mitsuru's Atk × Frostbound stacks \\(up to (\\d+) of Atk, (\\d+) turns\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Inflict Imperious Queen on 1 foe\\.\\nDecrease target's Def ([\\d\\.]+)% \\+ ([\\d\\.]+)% more per (\\d+) of Mitsuru's Atk \\(up to (\\d+) Atk\\)\\. Also, increase dmg taken ([\\d\\.]+)% per (\\d+) of Mitsuru's Atk \\(up to (\\d+) Atk\\)\\. Effects are permanent\\.\\nImperious Queen can only be active on 1 target at a time and transfers to new target whenever this skill is used\\. When target with Imperious Queen is KO'd, transfers to foe with highest HP\\. All debuffs inflicted by Mitsuru also transfer\\.\\nAfter using this skill, Mitsuru can use another skill in same turn \\(does not count as normal skill\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Can be activated when Theurgy gauge is at (\\d+)\\. Ice dmg to 1 foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\), evolve target's Frostbound to Snowbound and increase dmg taken ([\\d\\.]+)% \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nWhen an ally uses a skill to attack a foe with Snowbound, activate Iceblade (\\d+) time \\(([\\d\\.]+)% ally's Atk per Frostbound on target\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Increase party's stats by ([\\d\\.]+)% of Elucidator's stats \\((\\d+) turns\\)\\.\\nIce dmg to 1 foe \\(([\\d\\.]+)% Atk\\)\\. Increase skill dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% per Frostbound\\. Also, if target has (\\d+)\\+ Frostbound, increase this skill's dmg ([\\d\\.]+)% and crit rate ([\\d\\.]+)%\\.$\"": "",
